"info.mesh.disclaimer_title" = "Before you rely on it";
"info.mesh.disclaimer_description" = "Offline mesh is short range. Both phones need OSHI open to find each other, roughly 100 m apart in the open and much less through walls. It reaches further only when other people nearby also have OSHI open to pass the message along. If no one is in range, OSHI sends over the internet instead.";
